{
  "_doc": "Minion loadout recipes (docs/design/ENEMIES_BOSSES.md §1.3). Used only when no creature entry with the loadout id exists: the base minion (npc_scrapling / npc_blister, authored by the creature owner) is patched. Slot convention (docs/kits/minions.md): Scrapling l1 = Pipe Swing, l2 = Lid Bash, heavy = Pipe Smash, ability1 = Lid Up (a buff whose status carries guard_arc/guard_absorb), ability2 = Bolt Toss, passive scrap_projectile; Blister ability1 = Inflate & Pop (effects: area pop, zone puddle), passives death_pop (area) and live_bomb (delayed pop), art.palette.primary = sac colour.",
  "items": [
